msgstr "Sovbe'lu'bogh De'wI'"

msgid "No AT-SPI-exposed shortcuts found for this application.\nGTK app? Try Ctrl+? — many bind their own shortcuts window to it."
msgstr "De'wI'vam vaD AT-SPI mojaqmey tu'lu'be'.\nGTK De'wI' 'oH'a'? Ctrl+? yIqel — law' De'wI'mey chaH mojaq lonpa' chaH lo'."
